{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504150/extras/cr.png?t=1740514516\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crimen Exceptum</strong> is a spell-crafting action roguelike where you collect and combine powerful spells to fight enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COMBINE POWERFUL SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt to your situation by combining individual spells to create a massive variety of magic to use as your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504150/extras/gif1.gif?t=1740514516\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIGHT THE NECROMANCER'S ENVOYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your spells to engage in fast-paced combat against a range of unique enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504150/extras/gif2.gif?t=1740514516\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE AN ENCHANTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter an ever-changing world filled with magic, diverse biomes, creatures, and mystical places waiting to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504150/extras/biomes_gif.gif?t=1740514516\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504150?t=1740514516","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504150?t=1740514516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504150/9d38c9887c00a757d8f98b0b24e4e16a0e13da66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740514516","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504150/9d38c9887c00a757d8f98b0b